{"id":"b560939370c68b68","group":"89","path":"89/89-lem-gl-proof-closure.md","title":"Finite GL Proofs and the Least Closure","display":"lem-gl-proof-closure — Finite GL Proofs and the Least Closure","type":"lemma","metadata":{"type":"lemma","book":"The Logic of Provability","book_abbrev":"89","label":"89-lem-gl-proof-closure","aliases":["89-lem-gl-proof-closure"],"display":"lem-gl-proof-closure — Finite GL Proofs and the Least Closure","depends_on":["[[89-df-gl-derivable]]","[[89-df-gl-logic]]","[[89-df-gl-proof-system]]"],"created":"2026-10-05","revised":"2026-10-05"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"lemma"},{"key":"book","html":"The Logic of Provability"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"89"},{"key":"label","html":"89-lem-gl-proof-closure"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>89-lem-gl-proof-closure</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"lem-gl-proof-closure — Finite GL Proofs and the Least Closure"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"65efb02e976f40b6\" href=\"?note=65efb02e976f40b6\" title=\"89-df-gl-derivable\">89-df-gl-derivable</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"0006800fa1c85177\" href=\"?note=0006800fa1c85177\" title=\"89-df-gl-logic\">89-df-gl-logic</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"1cc1d3718e1d5f3b\" href=\"?note=1cc1d3718e1d5f3b\" title=\"89-df-gl-proof-system\">89-df-gl-proof-system</a></span></div>"},{"key":"created","html":"2026-10-05"},{"key":"revised","html":"2026-10-05"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal D_{G\\!L}\">\\(\\mathcal D_{G\\!L}\\)</span> 为既有有限 GL 推导的结论集；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{GL}\">\\(\\mathrm{GL}\\)</span> 为既有交集闭包。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal A_{G\\!L}=\\mathcal T_{\\Box}\\cup\\mathcal A_K\\cup\\mathcal A_L\">\\(\\mathcal A_{G\\!L}=\\mathcal T_{\\Box}\\cup\\mathcal A_K\\cup\\mathcal A_L\\)</span> 为同一演算的全部公理实例，规则仅为 MP 与必然化。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{lem\\text{-}gl\\text{-}proof\\text{-}closure}\\vdash\n\\mathcal D_{G\\!L}=\\mathrm{GL}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{lem\\text{-}gl\\text{-}proof\\text{-}closure}\\vdash\n\\mathcal D_{G\\!L}=\\mathrm{GL}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>来源：Boolos, <em>The Logic of Provability</em>，pp.4–6。原书以有限证明给 GL；本库的交集表示是等价的最小闭包规约，本引理给出两种接口之间的实际证明。</p>\n<p>一份有限证明逐行归纳：公理属于 GL，MP 与必然化保持成员性，故 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal D_{G\\!L}\\subseteq\\mathrm{GL}\">\\(\\mathcal D_{G\\!L}\\subseteq\\mathrm{GL}\\)</span>。</p>\n<p>反向，每条公理有单行证明。将 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\">\\(A\\)</span> 和 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\to B\">\\(A\\to B\\)</span> 的两份有限证明连接，对第二段的引用位置统一平移，再附一行 MP，得到 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"B\">\\(B\\)</span> 的证明；在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\">\\(A\\)</span> 的证明后附必然化行得到 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Box A\">\\(\\Box A\\)</span> 的证明。因此 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal D_{G\\!L}\">\\(\\mathcal D_{G\\!L}\\)</span> 含全部公理并对两个规则闭合。由 K 的交集定义先得 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm K\\subseteq\\mathcal D_{G\\!L}\">\\(\\mathrm K\\subseteq\\mathcal D_{G\\!L}\\)</span>，再由 GL 的交集定义得 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{GL}\\subseteq\\mathcal D_{G\\!L}\">\\(\\mathrm{GL}\\subseteq\\mathcal D_{G\\!L}\\)</span>。</p>\n<p>证明没有调用可靠性、完全性或可判定性，可在这些结果之前使用，也不对局部假设施用必然化。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"89-df-gl-derivable","status":"resolved","id":"65efb02e976f40b6","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-gl-derivable]]","embed":false},{"target":"89-df-gl-logic","status":"resolved","id":"0006800fa1c85177","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-gl-logic]]","embed":false},{"target":"89-df-gl-proof-system","status":"resolved","id":"1cc1d3718e1d5f3b","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-gl-proof-system]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathcal D_{G\\!L}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{GL}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal A_{G\\!L}=\\mathcal T_{\\Box}\\cup\\mathcal A_K\\cup\\mathcal A_L","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{lem\\text{-}gl\\text{-}proof\\text{-}closure}\\vdash\n\\mathcal D_{G\\!L}=\\mathrm{GL}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathcal D_{G\\!L}\\subseteq\\mathrm{GL}","display":false},{"tex":"A","display":false},{"tex":"A\\to B","display":false},{"tex":"B","display":false},{"tex":"A","display":false},{"tex":"\\Box A","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal D_{G\\!L}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm K\\subseteq\\mathcal D_{G\\!L}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{GL}\\subseteq\\mathcal D_{G\\!L}","display":false}],"bytes":1703,"backlinks":[{"id":"c2a8f862c318be2c","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"来源：Boolos 第 1 章 pp.4–6。由 [[89-lem-gl-proof-closure]]，本条有限推导定义的 $\\mathcal{T\\!h}_{G\\!L}=\\mathcal D_{G\\!L}$ 恰等于 [[89-df-gl-logic]] 的交集闭包 $\\mathrm{GL}$。后续在两个记号之间换用时使用这一已证明等式，不以标题“GL”替代接口等价的证明。"},{"id":"1b619488086561ea","anchor":"ref-11","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"[[89-thm-gl-decidable]] 给出总的特征函数 $d_{\\mathrm{GL}}$；据\n[[89-df-gl-decidability]] 取专用模态编码。对任意自然数 $n$，先计算 $\\mathrm{dec}_{\\Box}(n)$；非法码输出 0，合法码 $A$ 输出 $d_{\\mathrm{GL}}(A)$。两个程序都终止，且 [[89-lem-gl-proof-closure]] 证明 $\\mathcal{T\\!h}_{G\\!L}=\\mathrm{GL}$，所以这个全域程序恰是定理码集的特征函数。"},{"id":"05a599f85e508061","anchor":"ref-123","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[89-lem-gl-proof-closure]]"},{"id":"e0c421a5b45aeb77","anchor":"ref-41","locations":["正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"有限证明与闭包：[[89-df-gl-proof-system]] → [[89-df-gl-derivable]] → [[89-lem-gl-proof-closure]] → [[89-df-gl-theorem]]。"}],"outgoing":["65efb02e976f40b6","0006800fa1c85177","1cc1d3718e1d5f3b"]}